{"settings": {"_element_id": "sec-processo-commessa", "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#FFFFFF", "boxed_width": {"size": 1280, "unit": "px"}, "flex_direction": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "isLinked": true, "row": "48", "size": 48, "unit": "px"}, "padding": {"bottom": "112", "isLinked": false, "left": "48", "right": "48", "top": "112", "unit": "px"}, "padding_mobile": {"bottom": "56", "isLinked": false, "left": "20", "right": "20", "top": "64", "unit": "px"}}, "children": [{"widget_type": "container", "settings": {"animation": "fadeInUp", "animation_delay": 0, "animation_duration": "fast", "content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "isLinked": true, "row": "16", "size": 16, "unit": "px"}}, "children": [{"widget_type": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Il processo di commessa", "title_color": "#1E1E1E", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"size": 38, "unit": "px"}, "typography_font_size_mobile": {"size": 26, "unit": "px"}, "typography_font_weight": "700", "typography_line_height": {"size": 1.2, "unit": "em"}, "typography_typography": "custom"}}, {"widget_type": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Ogni commessa Leantech segue un percorso definito: dalla trattativa con il cliente alla verifica rispetto al Budget, dal layout e dalle distinte base all’assegnazione dei materiali, fino alla chiusura con il rientro a magazzino degli articoli non utilizzati.</p><p>Le varianti in corso d’opera vengono riviste e rilanciate, per ogni gruppo e sottogruppo modificato. La complessità non viene banalizzata: viene governata attraverso engineering, review, industrializzazione e test.</p>", "text_color": "#4A5560", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"size": 19, "unit": "px"}, "typography_line_height": {"size": 1.6, "unit": "em"}, "typography_typography": "custom", "width": {"size": 92, "unit": "%"}, "width_mobile": {"size": 100, "unit": "%"}}}]}, {"widget_type": "html", "settings": {"html": "<style>#lf-processo{--lf-ink:#0C2434;--lf-text:#4A5560;--lf-line:#6E8494;--lf-soft:#C7D5DE;--lf-accent:#1D8AC9;font-family:var(--e-global-typography-text-font-family,Roboto),Roboto,sans-serif;color:var(--lf-text);width:100%}\n#lf-processo *{box-sizing:border-box}\n#lf-processo ol,#lf-processo ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n.lf-leg{display:flex;gap:24px;margin:0 0 22px!important;font-size:14px;color:var(--lf-ink)}\n.lf-leg li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.lf-leg i{display:inline-block;width:34px;height:18px;border:2px solid var(--lf-line);border-radius:5px;background:#fff}\n.lf-leg i.d{border-style:dashed;background:transparent}\n.lf-lane{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lf-soft);border-left:5px solid var(--lf-accent);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 26px 26px;margin:0 0 18px}\n.lf-client{border-left-color:var(--lf-ink)}\n.lf-lh{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lf-ink)}\n.lf-flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n.lf-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px}\n.lf-row>li{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;position:relative}\n.lf-row>li.lf-wide{flex:2.4 1 0}\n.lf-client .lf-row>li{flex:0 1 25%}\n.lf-b{border:2px solid var(--lf-line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--lf-ink);font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;padding:13px 14px;min-height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;position:relative}\n.lf-o{border:2px dashed var(--lf-line);border-radius:12px;color:var(--lf-ink);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.4;padding:11px 12px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}\n.lf-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\n.lf-pair{gap:34px}\n.lf-arr{position:absolute;right:-30px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:26px;height:16px;color:var(--lf-accent);display:block}\n.lf-arr svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\n.lf-dn{display:block;height:24px;color:var(--lf-accent);text-align:center}\n.lf-dn svg{width:14px;height:24px}\n.lf-loop{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--lf-ink);border-top:2px solid var(--lf-accent);padding-top:10px}\n.lf-loop span{font-size:20px;color:var(--lf-accent);margin-right:4px}\n.lf-play{flex:0 0 auto;margin-left:auto;width:32px;height:32px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--lf-accent);cursor:pointer;border-radius:50%;line-height:0;white-space:normal;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none}\n.lf-play svg{width:32px;height:32px}\n.lf-play:hover,.lf-play:focus{background:transparent;color:var(--lf-ink)}\n.lf-play:focus-visible,.lf-x:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--lf-ink);outline-offset:2px}\n.lf-dlg{border:0;padding:0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;width:min(960px,92vw);background:#06141d}\n.lf-dlg::backdrop{background:rgba(6,20,29,.82)}\n.lf-dv{aspect-ratio:16/9;position:relative}\n.lf-dv video{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;background:#06141d}\n.lf-x{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fff;background:rgba(12,36,52,.85);color:#fff;font-size:26px;line-height:1;padding:0;cursor:pointer;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none}\n.lf-x:hover,.lf-x:focus{background:rgba(12,36,52,.85);color:#fff}\n@media (max-width:1023px){\n.lf-lane{padding:18px 14px 20px}\n.lf-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:30px}\n.lf-row>li,.lf-row>li.lf-wide,.lf-client .lf-row>li{flex:none}\n.lf-pair{gap:30px}\n.lf-col{margin-left:16px;gap:28px}\n.lf-arr{right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-27px;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg)}\n.lf-leg{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 20px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#lf-processo *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}</style><div id=\"lf-processo\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Il processo di commessa Leantech\"><ul class=\"lf-leg\" aria-label=\"Legenda\"><li><i></i>Attività</li><li><i class=\"d\"></i>Esito, decisione o stato</li></ul><section class=\"lf-lane lf-client\" aria-labelledby=\"lf-l1\"><h3 id=\"lf-l1\" class=\"lf-lh\">Cliente</h3><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Gestione commessa: operazioni burocratiche, trattativa con i clienti</li></ol></section><section class=\"lf-lane\" aria-labelledby=\"lf-l2\"><h3 id=\"lf-l2\" class=\"lf-lh\">Leantech</h3><div class=\"lf-flow\"><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Proposta ordine cliente<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Verifica proposta rispetto a Budget da parte della direzione<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-fork \"><ul class=\"lf-col\"><li class=\"lf-o \">Rifiuto ordine cliente</li><li class=\"lf-o \">Approvazione ordine cliente<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li></ul></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Aggiornamento elenco commesse e attivazione della nuova commessa sul gestionale</li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Disegno del layout commessa da parte dell’Ufficio Tecnico<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-progettazione-laptop-autocad-linee-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-progettazione-laptop-autocad-linee-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Primo piano di un laptop con il disegno CAD di un layout\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Disegno del layout commessa da parte dell’Ufficio Tecnico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button><span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Approvazione progetto da parte del cliente (se necessarie si effettuano modifiche, rimanendo nei limiti di Budget)<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Progettazione distinte base da parte dell’Ufficio Tecnico interno (per ogni gruppo e sottogruppo)<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-progettazione-cad-modello-trasportatore-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-progettazione-cad-modello-trasportatore-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Modello 3D di un trasportatore su monitor\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Progettazione distinte base da parte dell’Ufficio Tecnico interno (per ogni gruppo e sottogruppo)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button><span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Inserimento distinte di base sul gestionale</li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Ordine cliente (sul gestionale)<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Assegnazione materiali a commessa<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Controllo fisico a magazzino delle disponibilità<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-logistica-magazzino-carrello-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-logistica-magazzino-carrello-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Magazzino con scaffalature, ripresa dall’alto\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Controllo fisico a magazzino delle disponibilità\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button><span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-fork lf-wide\"><ul class=\"lf-col\"><li><ol class=\"lf-row lf-pair\"><li class=\"lf-o \">Articoli disponibili e fisicamente presenti a magazzino<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Prelievo materiali da magazzino centrale (carico su commessa)<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-logistica-magazzino-carrello-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-logistica-magazzino-carrello-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Magazzino con scaffalature, ripresa dall’alto\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Prelievo materiali da magazzino centrale (carico su commessa)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button></li></ol></li><li><ol class=\"lf-row lf-pair\"><li class=\"lf-o \">Articoli non disponibili<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Ordine fornitore (acquisto materiali imputati direttamente alla commessa)</li></ol></li></ul></li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Rettifiche/modifiche alla commessa derivanti da nuovi accordi o varianti in corso d’opera<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-officina-smerigliatura-scintille-dettaglio-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-officina-smerigliatura-scintille-dettaglio-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Intervento in officina su un profilo metallico, con scintille\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Rettifiche/modifiche alla commessa derivanti da nuovi accordi o varianti in corso d’opera\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button><span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Revisione ordine cliente (revisione manuale, tramite gestionale, per ogni gruppo e sottogruppo modificato)<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-fork \"><ul class=\"lf-col\"><li class=\"lf-o \">Modifiche riduttive</li><li class=\"lf-o \">Modifiche integrative</li></ul></li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Rilancio dell’ordine cliente per i materiali aggiuntivi<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Rilancio assegnazione materiali a commessa<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Controllo fisico a magazzino<span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-o \">Prelievo da magazzino centrale oppure ordine fornitore, come sopra</li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Ulteriori rettifiche/modifiche alla commessa</li><li class=\"lf-loop\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↻</span> Il ciclo può ripetersi: si torna alle rettifiche/modifiche alla commessa</li></ol><span class=\"lf-dn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 1v22M2 17l6 7 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol class=\"lf-row \"><li class=\"lf-b\">Completamento commessa<button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-play\" data-video=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-sistema-nastro-maglia-modulo-giallo-card.mp4\" data-poster=\"https://leantech.propagandaadv.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lt-sistema-nastro-maglia-modulo-giallo-poster.webp\" data-label=\"Linea di trasporto a maglia completata, in funzione\" aria-label=\"Guarda il video: Completamento commessa\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M9.5 7.5v9l7-4.5z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg></button><span class=\"lf-arr\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M1 8h22M17 2l7 6-7 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></li><li class=\"lf-b\">Scarico da commessa e carico a magazzino centrale degli articoli non utilizzati (solo se riutilizzabili per altre commesse)</li></ol></div></section><dialog class=\"lf-dlg\" aria-label=\"Video\"><div class=\"lf-dv\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"lf-x\" aria-label=\"Chiudi il video\">×</button></dialog></div><script>(function(){var R=document.getElementById('lf-processo');if(!R||R.__lf){return;}R.__lf=1;\nvar d=R.querySelector('.lf-dlg'),h=R.querySelector('.lf-dv'),x=R.querySelector('.lf-x'),rm=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'),last=null;\nif(!d||typeof d.showModal!=='function'){[].forEach.call(R.querySelectorAll('.lf-play'),function(b){b.hidden=true;});return;}\nfunction close(){var v=h.querySelector('video');if(v){try{v.pause();v.removeAttribute('src');v.load();}catch(e){}}h.innerHTML='';if(d.open){d.close();}if(last){last.focus();}}\n[].forEach.call(R.querySelectorAll('.lf-play'),function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){last=b;h.innerHTML='';\nvar v=document.createElement('video');v.muted=true;v.loop=true;v.setAttribute('playsinline','');v.setAttribute('muted','');v.preload='none';v.setAttribute('aria-label',b.getAttribute('data-label')||'');\nv.poster=b.getAttribute('data-poster')||'';if(rm.matches){v.controls=true;}h.appendChild(v);d.setAttribute('aria-label',b.getAttribute('data-label')||'Video');d.showModal();\nv.src=b.getAttribute('data-video');if(!rm.matches){var p=v.play();if(p&&p.catch){p.catch(function(){});}}x.focus();});});\nx.addEventListener('click',close);d.addEventListener('cancel',function(e){e.preventDefault();close();});\nd.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target===d){close();}});})();</script>"}}]}